// curation_overrides.jsonl — the audited LLM-curation pass over the seed
// pipeline's rule output (plan 0013, Simon's seed-default methodology:
// rules are scaffolding, not the decider). One JSON object per line, every
// override with a reason; consumed by gen_measures.ts (drop/add_measure)
// and gen_seed.ts → seed_curation.sql (density / allowed_units).
// Reviewed 2026-08-29 against the full 291-ingredient listing.
//
// --- measures: rule output a human finds senseless -------------------------
{"kind": "drop_measure", "match_text": "corn tortilla", "label": "enchilada", "reason": "an enchilada is a dish made from a tortilla, not a unit of tortilla"}
